WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.153
Toad was sitting by his boats.

2
00:00:03.154 --> 00:00:05.423
He looked up from a map.

3
00:00:05.424 --> 00:00:08.826
"Hooray!" cried Toad.

4
00:00:08.827 --> 00:00:13.237
He danced around Mole and Rat.

5
00:00:13.238 --> 00:00:18.077
"What are you up to now, Toad?" asked Rat.

6
00:00:18.078 --> 00:00:20.944
"How wonderful!" cried Toad.

7
00:00:20.945 --> 00:00:23.579
"Friends to travel with!"

8
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.406
Rat looked a little worried.

9
00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:32.051
"You have a nice home," said Mole shyly.

10
00:00:32.052 --> 00:00:36.233
"Finest house on the whole river!" said Toad.

11
00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:39.994
"In the whole world!

12
00:00:39.995 --> 00:00:42.785
" Rat winked at

13
00:00:42.786 --> 00:00:46.484
Mole. "Toad is always saying that," said

14
00:00:46.485 --> 00:00:50.570
Rat. Toad giggled. "Oh, Ratty," he

15
00:00:50.571 --> 00:00:53.081
said. "That’s just the way I

16
00:00:53.082 --> 00:00:56.555
am." Rat pointed to the pile of

17
00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.577
boats. "How is your boating

18
00:00:59.578 --> 00:01:02.239
going?" "Boating?" cried Toad.

19
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.204
"Forget that! It’s a waste of time!"

20
00:01:06.205 --> 00:01:08.704
"What?" Rat said.

21
00:01:08.705 --> 00:01:10.506
"Come with me, Rat.

22
00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:14.190
Bring your friend!" said Toad.

23
00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.310
They all walked to the stable.

24
00:01:17.311 --> 00:01:18.964
"There you are!"

25
00:01:18.965 --> 00:01:22.946
Toad pointed to a new yellow cart.

26
00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:24.714
"The open road!

27
00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:28.334
Travel and adventure!" cried Toad.

28
00:01:28.335 --> 00:01:33.267
"Harrumph!" Rat put his hands in his pockets.

29
00:01:33.268 --> 00:01:37.483
Mole stepped into the cart to look.

30
00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:42.296
His eyes opened wide with wonder.

31
00:01:42.297 --> 00:01:46.334
"I’ve got everything inside," said Toad.

32
00:01:46.335 --> 00:01:50.915
"Beds, a stove, pots and pans!

33
00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:55.086
All the food you can eat!"

34
00:01:55.087 --> 00:01:59.664
"There’s even a bird in a cage!" said Mole.

35
00:01:59.665 --> 00:02:06.836
"We start our trip this afternoon!" shouted Toad.

